# The scenario WORLD: the scenarios themselves, the films, and the terrain + building definitions they stand on
# (terrain.json, world geojson, premises, roads, building templates). The height grids (*.asc) are long and
# say nothing a reader can use, so they stay out. Kept out of dmp-HROT.Subsys.dumpfilter so no file is sent twice.
- *

+ scenarios
+ films
+ Hrot/Subsystems/Hrot.AI.Behaviors/Recipes/Terrain
+ Hrot/Subsystems/Hrot.AI.Behaviors/Recipes/Buildings

- **/*.asc
- **/.*
- **/obj
- **/bin
- **/build
- **/artifacts
- TestResults
